{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>לרבעה.</b> The heh is not pronounced." "<b>They shall surely be put to death, their blood is upon them.</b> Because the beast too transgressed and breached the fence of the world, like the beasts of the generation of the flood; and the woman was not forced by it, for coercion is only with awareness. But regarding a man who lies with a beast, it is not written דמיהם בם, for the beast did not transgress if the man lay with it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:46.973705280Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}